      },
      {
        "page_number": 327,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The effects of ice on aircraft are cumulative—thrust is ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              44.11600112915039,
              524.3795776367188,
              54.11600112915039
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Unforecast Adverse Weather",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 12.0,
            "color": "#EF4044",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              44.9842414855957,
              199.14004516601562,
              56.9842414855957
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "reduced, drag increases, lift lessens, and weight increases. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              56.61600112915039,
              524.4901123046875,
              66.61599731445312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Inadvertent Thunderstorm Encounter",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              62.49297332763672,
              212.69000244140625,
              72.49297332763672
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The results are an increase in stall speed and a deterioration ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              69.11599731445312,
              524.489990234375,
              79.11599731445312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A pilot should avoid flying through a thunderstorm of any ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              75.46597290039062,
              275.489990234375,
              85.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of aircraft performance. In extreme cases, two to three inches ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              81.61599731445312,
              524.5794067382812,
              91.61599731445312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "intensity. However, certain conditions may be present ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              87.96597290039062,
              275.56005859375,
              97.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of ice can form on the leading edge of the airfoil in less than 5 ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              94.11599731445312,
              524.46044921875,
              104.11599731445312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "that could lead to an inadvertent thunderstorm encounter. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              100.46597290039062,
              275.5,
              110.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "minutes. It takes only ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              285.0,
              106.61599731445312,
              370.1798400878906,
              116.61599731445312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For example, flying in areas where thunderstorms are ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              112.96597290039062,
              275.3699645996094,
              122.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of some aircraft by 50 percent and increases the frictional ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              119.11318969726562,
              524.4989624023438,
              129.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "embedded in large cloud masses may make thunderstorm ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              125.46597290039062,
              275.510009765625,
              135.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "drag by an equal percentage.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              131.61318969726562,
              399.67889404296875,
              141.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "avoidance difficult, even when the aircraft is equipped ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              137.96597290039062,
              275.4400634765625,
              147.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "with thunderstorm detection equipment. Therefore, pilots ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              150.46597290039062,
              275.53997802734375,
              160.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A pilot can expect icing when flying in visible precipitation, ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              156.61318969726562,
              524.52880859375,
              166.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "must be prepared to deal with an inadvertent thunderstorm ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              162.96597290039062,
              275.5199890136719,
              172.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "such as rain or cloud droplets, and the temperature is ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              169.11318969726562,
              524.62890625,
              179.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "penetration. At the very least, a thunderstorm encounter ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              175.46597290039062,
              275.489990234375,
              185.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "between +02 and –10° Celsius. When icing is detected, a ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              181.61318969726562,
              524.5090942382812,
              191.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "subjects the aircraft to turbulence that could be severe. The ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              187.96597290039062,
              275.510009765625,
              197.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "pilot should do one of two things, particularly if the aircraft ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              194.11318969726562,
              524.5088500976562,
              204.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "pilot and passengers should tighten seat belts and shoulder ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              200.46597290039062,
              275.489990234375,
              210.46597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is not equipped with deicing equipment: leave the area of ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              206.61318969726562,
              524.4989624023438,
              216.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "harnesses, and secure any loose items in the cabin.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              212.96597290039062,
              238.18002319335938,
              222.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "precipitation or go to an altitude where the temperature is ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              219.11318969726562,
              524.5089111328125,
              229.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "above freezing. This “warmer” altitude may not always be ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              231.61318969726562,
              524.4888305664062,
              241.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "As with any emergency, the first order of business during ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              237.96597290039062,
              275.5,
              247.96597290039062
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "a lower altitude. Proper preflight action includes obtaining ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              244.11318969726562,
              524.4988403320312,
              254.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "an inadvertent thunderstorm encounter must be to fly the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              250.46597290039062,
              275.5899353027344,
              260.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "information on the freezing level and the above-freezing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              256.6131896972656,
              524.4487915039062,
              266.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "aircraft. The pilot workload is heavy; therefore, increased ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              262.9659729003906,
              275.50006103515625,
              272.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "levels in precipitation areas.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              269.1131896972656,
              397.19891357421875,
              279.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "concentration is necessary to maintain an instrument scan. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              275.4659729003906,
              275.49005126953125,
              285.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If a pilot inadvertently enters a thunderstorm, it is better to ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              287.9659729003906,
              275.5099792480469,
              297.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If neither option is available, consider an immediate landing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              294.1131896972656,
              524.5088500976562,
              304.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "maintain a course straight through the thunderstorm rather ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              300.4659729003906,
              275.5000305175781,
              310.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "at the nearest suitable airport. Even if the aircraft is equipped ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              306.6131896972656,
              524.5484008789062,
              316.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "than turning around. A straight course minimizes the amount ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              312.9659729003906,
              275.39007568359375,
              322.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "with anti-icing/deicing equipment, it is not designed to allow ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              319.1131896972656,
              524.3489990234375,
              329.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of time in the thunderstorm, and turning maneuvers only ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              325.4659729003906,
              275.4098815917969,
              335.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "aircraft to operate indefinitely in icing conditions. Anti-",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              331.6131896972656,
              522.0084838867188,
              341.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "increase structural stress on the aircraft.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              337.9659729003906,
              194.84002685546875,
              347.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "icing/deicing equipment gives a pilot more time to get out of ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              344.1131896972656,
              524.4989624023438,
              354.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the icing conditions. Report icing to ATC and request new ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              356.6131896972656,
              524.5089111328125,
              366.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Reduce power to a setting that maintains a speed at the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              362.9659729003906,
              275.30987548828125,
              372.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "routing or altitude. Be sure to report the type of aircraft, and ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              369.1131896972656,
              524.5187377929688,
              379.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "recommended turbulence penetration speed as described in the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              375.4659729003906,
              275.3101806640625,
              385.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "use the following terms when reporting icing to ATC: ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              381.6131896972656,
              503.03887939453125,
              391.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pilot’s Operating Handbook/Airplane Flight Manual (POH/",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              387.9659729003906,
              272.9999694824219,
              397.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1.\t",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              293.9989013671875,
              398.6131896972656,
              303.9989013671875,
              408.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "AFM), and try to minimize additional power adjustments. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              400.4659729003906,
              275.5,
              410.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Concentrate on maintaining a level attitude while allowing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              412.9659729003906,
              275.5000305175781,
              422.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "airspeed and altitude to fluctuate. Similarly, if using the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              425.4659729003906,
              275.3100280761719,
              435.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "autopilot, disengage the altitude hold and speed hold modes, ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              437.9659729003906,
              275.4900207519531,
              447.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "as they only increase the aircraft’s maneuvering—thereby ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              450.4659729003906,
              275.5000305175781,
              460.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2.\t",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              293.9989013671875,
              453.1131896972656,
              303.9989013671875,
              463.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "increasing structural stress.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              462.9659729003906,
              144.5900115966797,
              472.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "During a thunderstorm encounter, the potential for icing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              487.9659729003906,
              275.51025390625,
              497.9659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "also exists. As soon as possible, turn on anti-icing/deicing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              500.4659729003906,
              275.5199890136719,
              510.4659729003906
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "equipment and carburetor heat, if equipped. Icing can be ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              512.9660034179688,
              275.65008544921875,
              522.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "3.\t",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              293.9989013671875,
              520.1132202148438,
              303.9989013671875,
              530.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "rapid at any altitude and may lead to power failure and/or ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              525.4660034179688,
              275.5,
              535.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "loss of airspeed indication.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              537.9660034179688,
              143.2100067138672,
              547.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lightning is also present in a thunderstorm and can ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              562.9660034179688,
              275.4801025390625,
              572.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "4.\t",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              293.9989013671875,
              574.6132202148438,
              303.9989013671875,
              584.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "temporarily blind a pilot. To reduce this risk, turn up flight ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              575.4660034179688,
              275.5099792480469,
              585.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "deck lights to the highest intensity, concentrate on the flight ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              587.9660034179688,
              275.4700012207031,
              597.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "instruments, and resist the urge to look outside.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              600.4660034179688,
              225.16000366210938,
              610.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Early ice detection is critical and is particularly difficult during ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              624.6132202148438,
              524.4583740234375,
              634.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Inadvertent Icing Encounter",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              625.4929809570312,
              168.24998474121094,
              635.4929809570312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "night flight. Use a flashlight to check for ice accumulation on ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              637.1132202148438,
              524.44921875,
              647.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Because icing is unpredictable in nature, pilots may find ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              638.4660034179688,
              275.39984130859375,
              648.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the wings. At the first indication of ice accumulation, take ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              649.6132202148438,
              524.5089111328125,
              659.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "themselves in icing conditions even though they have done ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              650.9660034179688,
              275.489990234375,
              660.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "action to get out of the icing conditions. Refer to the POH/",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              662.1132202148438,
              521.97900390625,
              672.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "everything practicable to avoid it. In order to stay alert to this ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              663.4660034179688,
              275.39013671875,
              673.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "AFM for the proper use of anti-icing/deicing equipment. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              284.9989013671875,
              674.6132202148438,
              513.578857421875,
              684.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "possibility while operating in visible moisture, pilots should ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              675.9660034179688,
              275.5100402832031,
              685.9660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "monitor the outside air temperature (OAT).",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              36.0,
              688.4660034179688,
              209.30001831054688,
              698.4660034179688
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "⁄",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              372.17889404296875,
              106.61318969726562,
              373.8489074707031,
              116.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " inch of ice to reduce the lifting power ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              376.4888916015625,
              106.61318969726562,
              524.5185546875,
              116.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 5.5,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              369.4678039550781,
              106.93235778808594,
              372.2178039550781,
              112.43235778808594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 5.5,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              373.77789306640625,
              110.13236999511719,
              376.52789306640625,
              115.63236999511719
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trace. Ice becomes perceptible. Rate of accumulation ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              398.6131896972656,
              524.62939453125,
              408.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is slightly greater than sublimation. Anti-icing/deicing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              411.1131896972656,
              524.4490356445312,
              421.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "equipment is not utilized unless encountered for an ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              423.6131896972656,
              524.4888916015625,
              433.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "extended period of time (over 1 hour).",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              436.1131896972656,
              465.0188293457031,
              446.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Light. The rate of accumulation may create a problem ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              453.1131896972656,
              524.3889770507812,
              463.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "if flight is prolonged in this environment (over 1 ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              465.6131896972656,
              524.549560546875,
              475.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "hour). Occasional use of anti-icing/deicing  equipment ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              478.1131896972656,
              524.49951171875,
              488.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "removes/prevents accumulation. It does not present a ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              490.6131896972656,
              524.4889526367188,
              500.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "problem if anti-icing/deicing equipment is used.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              503.1131896972656,
              504.2088928222656,
              513.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Moderate. The rate of accumulation is such that even ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              520.1132202148438,
              524.4889526367188,
              530.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "short encounters become potentially hazardous and ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              532.6132202148438,
              524.4989013671875,
              542.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "use of anti-icing/deicing equipment or flight diversion ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              545.1132202148438,
              524.4788818359375,
              555.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is necessary.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              557.6132202148438,
              362.5389404296875,
              567.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Severe. The rate of accumulation is such that antiicing/deicing equipment fails to reduce or control the ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              574.6132202148438,
              521.9789428710938,
              584.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "hazard. Immediate flight diversion is necessary.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              311.9989013671875,
              599.6132202148438,
              502.7989196777344,
              609.6132202148438
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
